1
00:00:00.446 --> 00:00:03.529
Unit eight. Skin Care and Acne!

2
00:00:04.457 --> 00:00:08.118
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.168 --> 00:00:11.292
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.342 --> 00:00:14.975
Today we learn about Skin Care and Acne. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:19.248
Acne. Say it with me. Acne!

6
00:00:22.782 --> 00:00:26.332
Oil glands. Say it with me. Oil glands!

7
00:00:29.782 --> 00:00:33.182
Pores. Say it with me. Pores!

8
00:00:36.696 --> 00:00:40.496
Face wash. Say it with me. Face wash!

9
00:00:44.001 --> 00:00:47.617
Squeeze. Say it with me. Squeeze!

10
00:00:51.089 --> 00:00:54.606
Sunscreen. Say it with me. Sunscreen!

11
00:00:58.144 --> 00:01:00.927
Diet. Say it with me. Diet!

12
00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:08.524
Dermatologist. Say it with me. Dermatologist!

13
00:01:11.986 --> 00:01:22.976
Acne happens when oil glands and dead skin block pores. A gentle face wash twice a day helps; squeezing spots can cause scars. For severe acne, a dermatologist can help.

14
