16
00:01:32.336 --> 00:01:33.486
Pores!

17
00:01:34.401 --> 00:01:39.580
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:40.780
Diet!

19
00:01:41.677 --> 00:01:46.051
Did you know? Acne is very common — most teenagers get it at some point!

20
00:01:46.101 --> 00:01:48.228
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.683 --> 00:01:57.297
Think and answer. Why should you avoid squeezing pimples?

22
